Panel  &MAIN = AUDIT PANEL
&VARS = (MAIN), &MODE = (MODE)
%%Header
  +-----------------------------------------------------------+
  |      ISPF MAINFRAME COMPLIANCE AUDITOR                    |
  +-----------------------------------------------------------+
%%Menu
  |  1. Select Audit Scope (Datasets, Security DBs)           |
  |  2. Configure Policy Rules & Weights                      |
  |  3. Execute Real-Time Compliance Scan                     |
  |  4. View Preliminary Results & Scores                     |
  |  5. Generate Remediation Recommendations                  |
  |  6. Exit to ISPF Main Menu                              |
%%Input
  &MODE.IF=(=1), &MODE.=SCAN  
  &MODE.IF=(=2), &MODE.=CONF  
  &MODE.IF=(=3), &MODE.=EXEC  
  &MODE.IF=(=4), &MODE.=VIEW  
  &MODE.IF=(=5), &MODE.=REMED 
  &MODE.IF=(=6), &MODE.=EXIT 
%%Footer
  +-----------------------------------------------------------+
  |  F3=Exit  F12=Cancel  /MODE=Command                        |
  +-----------------------------------------------------------+
%%Panel
